Addendum:  My wife tells me she thinks all male characters should run
a 1 in 10 risk of being red/green colorblind, and that this should be
an intrinsic.  To such characters, red and green should look look like
brown.  She adds that perhaps colorblindness should be extended beyond
just red and green, just to make it have a somewhat more significant
impact on the game.

She also says that sometimes male humanoids should get groin injuries.
You can fight with a groin injury, but only after a momentary recoil.
(It pains me to even think of this scenario.)  Maybe female characters
should know about this human, or humanoid, male weakness (you know, ^D).

